{@link Ext.Menu}'s are used with {@link Ext.Viewport#method!setMenu Ext.Viewport#setMenu}. A menu can be linked with any side of the screen (top, left, bottom or right)
 and will simply describe the contents of your menu. To use this menu you will call various menu related functions on the {@link Ext.Viewport}
such as {@link Ext.Viewport#method!showMenu Ext.Viewport#showMenu}, {@link Ext.Viewport#method!hideMenu Ext.Viewport#hideMenu}, {@link Ext.Viewport#method!toggleMenu Ext.Viewport#toggleMenu}, {@link Ext.Viewport#method!hideOtherMenus Ext.Viewport#hideOtherMenus},
or {@link Ext.Viewport#method!hideAllMenus Ext.Viewport#hideAllMenus}.

