You must use a HTML5 doctype for {@link #cfg!docked #docked} `{@link #cfg!bottom bottom}` to work. To do this, simply add the following code to the HTML file:

    <!doctype html>

So your index.html file should look a little like this:

    <!doctype html>
    <html>
        <head>
            <title>MY application title</title>
            ...

